385	// fetchAndMergeRef fetches a remote custom ref and merges it into the local ref.
386	// Uses the same tree-flattening merge as v1 (sharded paths are unique, so no conflicts).
387	//
388	// For /full/current: if the remote has archived generations not present locally,
